<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.140"><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L1">在月色澄澈的夜里</text><text for="L2">独自一人在森林深处</text><text for="L3">在启程离开这世界之前</text><text for="L4">往昔岁月一一浮现</text><text for="L5">生活并不富足 可即便如此</text><text for="L6">无论何时 身旁都有母亲的温柔</text><text for="L7">是她告诉我 最喜欢我画的画</text><text for="L8">为了让我们两个人活下去 她放弃梦想不停工作</text><text for="L9">可离别终究还是来临</text><text for="L10">就在那时 我遇见了你</text><text for="L11">坠入爱河</text><text for="L12">也终于懂得了爱</text><text for="L13">这就是幸福</text><text for="L14">明明曾这样以为</text><text for="L15">为什么</text><text for="L16">偏偏总是最珍贵的一切</text><text for="L17">一件件消失 一件件远去</text><text for="L18">我要和这个世界</text><text for="L19">说再见了</text><text for="L20">我这就去见你</text><text for="L21">去到你所在的地方</text><text for="L22">我爱你 对不起</text><text for="L23">就在那一刻 我听见了你的声音</text><text for="L24">若就这样亲手把一切</text><text for="L25">全都结束 那么以后</text><text for="L26">你就再也见不到任何人了 永远</text><text for="L27">在那轮满月之夜</text><text for="L28">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</text><text for="L29">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</text><text for="L30">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</text><text for="L31">我终究没能结束一切</text><text for="L32">跌落地面的我 忽然</text><text for="L33">听见月亮向我开口</text><text for="L34">还赐予我不可思议的力量</text><text for="L35">能将自己的生命分予笔下之物</text><text for="L36">连将枯的草木也重新有了生机</text><text for="L37">代价是我余下的时间</text><text for="L38">我以自己的生命为源 一笔笔画下去</text><text for="L39">一点一点将它分出去</text><text for="L40">于是我有了活下去的意义</text><text for="L41">就在那时 我遇见了你</text><text for="L42">同我一样 活在悲伤中的人</text><text for="L43">曾为执意离世的我而生气的人</text><text for="L44">不知不觉间 我被你吸引</text><text for="L45">可你心中已有深爱的人</text><text for="L46">那个背叛过你的狠心之人</text><text for="L47">却仍是你无法停止爱着的人</text><text for="L48">而如今 他的生命正要熄灭</text><text for="L49">你哭着呼喊他的名字</text><text for="L50">看着这样的你 我下定决心</text><text for="L51">只为自己留下一天</text><text for="L52">将余下的生命尽数奉上 画下了他</text><text for="L53">然后 他睁开了眼睛</text><text for="L54">啊 面对我亲手唤起的奇迹</text><text for="L55">望着喜极而泣的你</text><text for="L56">有句话我无论如何都想告诉你</text><text for="L57">在我生命尽头 请听听我的心意</text><text for="L58">是你就这样让我懂得活着的喜悦</text><text for="L59">给予我这一切的你</text><text for="L60">我真的真的好喜欢你</text><text for="L61">再见了</text><text for="L62">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</text><text for="L63">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</text><text for="L64">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</text><text for="L65">而后只剩我一人</text><text for="L66">想着你 也想着母亲</text><text for="L67">又想着从前的你 缓缓闭上双眼</text><text for="L68">漫长漫长的旅途走到了尽头</text><text for="L69">终于又见到你了</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:21.627"><div begin="4.737" end="22.832"><p begin="4.737" end="8.378" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4.737" end="5.277">月が</span><span begin="5.277" end="6.436">綺麗</span><span begin="6.436" end="6.729">な</span><span begin="6.729" end="7.622">夜</span><span begin="7.622" end="8.378">に</span></p><p begin="9.392" end="13.353" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.392" end="10.009">森の</span><span begin="10.009" end="11.240">中で</span><span begin="11.240" end="11.720">ただ</span><span begin="11.720" end="12.384">ひ</span><span begin="12.384" end="12.639">と</span><span begin="12.639" end="13.353">り</span></p><p begin="14.226" end="17.822" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.226" end="14.520">この</span><span begin="14.520" end="15.425">世界</span><span begin="15.425" end="15.961">から</span><span begin="16.062" end="16.617">旅立つ</span><span begin="16.661" end="17.822">前に</span></p><p begin="19.019" end="22.832" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.019" end="19.311">これ</span><span begin="19.311" end="20.238">までの</span><span begin="20.238" end="20.825">日</span><span begin="20.825" end="21.220">々を</span><span begin="21.220" end="22.832">浮かべる</span></p></div><div begin="23.896" end="42.489"><p begin="23.896" end="26.133" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.896" end="24.321">裕福</span><span begin="24.393" end="24.575">じゃ</span><span begin="24.575" end="24.796">ない</span><span begin="24.936" end="25.180">暮らし</span><span begin="25.249" end="25.580">それ</span><span begin="25.753" end="26.133">でも</span></p><p begin="26.257" end="29.465" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.257" end="26.532">いつ</span><span begin="26.532" end="26.715">だっ</span><span begin="26.801" end="26.962">て</span><span begin="26.962" end="27.153">そ</span><span begin="27.255" end="27.418">ば</span><span begin="27.418" end="27.596">に</span><span begin="27.679" end="27.842">は</span><span begin="27.842" end="28.521">母の</span><span begin="28.653" end="29.465">優しさ</span></p><p begin="29.475" end="32.858" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.475" end="29.873">僕の</span><span begin="29.873" end="30.455">描く絵を</span><span begin="30.572" end="31.514">大好きだと</span><span begin="31.514" end="31.986">言って</span><span begin="31.986" end="32.376">くれた</span><span begin="32.376" end="32.858">人</span></p><p begin="32.914" end="35.899" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.914" end="34.253">二人生きるために</span><span begin="34.253" end="34.948">夢も捨て</span><span begin="35.091" end="35.581">働</span><span begin="35.581" end="35.899">いて</span></p><p begin="35.984" end="37.801" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.984" end="36.513">それでも</span><span begin="36.513" end="37.165">訪れる</span><span begin="37.165" end="37.801">別れ</span></p><p begin="37.976" end="40.187" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.976" end="38.452">そんな</span><span begin="38.452" end="39.016">時に</span><span begin="39.082" end="39.557">君に</span><span begin="39.557" end="40.187">出会い</span></p><p begin="40.403" end="41.480" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.403" end="40.821">恋に</span><span begin="40.821" end="41.480">落ちた</span></p><p begin="41.614" end="42.489" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.614" end="41.964">愛を</span><span begin="41.964" end="42.489">知った</span></p></div><div begin="42.516" end="55.552"><p begin="42.516" end="43.686" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.516" end="43.323">幸せだ</span><span begin="43.323" end="43.686">と</span></p><p begin="43.767" end="45.171" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.767" end="44.027">思</span><span begin="44.114" end="44.449">えた</span><span begin="44.697" end="45.171">のに</span></p><p begin="45.259" end="45.926" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.259" end="45.605">どうし</span><span begin="45.605" end="45.926">て</span></p><p begin="46.056" end="48.216" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.056" end="47.213">大切なも</span><span begin="47.470" end="48.216">のばかりが</span></p><p begin="48.363" end="50.152" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.363" end="48.675">消えて</span><span begin="48.675" end="49.083">いく</span><span begin="49.258" end="49.569">消えて</span><span begin="49.569" end="50.152">いく</span></p><p begin="51.140" end="53.073" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.140" end="51.739">この</span><span begin="51.739" end="53.073">世界と</span></p><p begin="53.572" end="55.552" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.572" end="54.610">さよなら</span><span begin="54.610" end="55.552">しよう</span></p></div><div begin="55.597" end="1:14.587"><p begin="55.597" end="58.096" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.597" end="56.134">会いに</span><span begin="56.134" end="56.508">行くよ</span><span begin="56.551" end="57.019">今すぐ</span><span begin="57.065" end="57.441">そ</span><span begin="57.441" end="58.096">こへ</span></p><p begin="58.225" end="59.824" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.225" end="58.882">君がいる</span><span begin="58.882" end="59.344">ところ</span><span begin="59.344" end="59.824">まで</span></p><p begin="1:00.442" end="1:01.911" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.442" end="1:01.137">愛してる</span><span begin="1:01.137" end="1:01.911">ごめんね</span></p><p begin="1:01.915" end="1:04.240" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.915" end="1:02.181">その</span><span begin="1:02.181" end="1:02.503">時</span><span begin="1:02.503" end="1:03.030">君の</span><span begin="1:03.099" end="1:03.575">声が</span><span begin="1:03.575" end="1:03.997">聞こえ</span><span begin="1:03.997" end="1:04.240">た</span></p><p begin="1:04.503" end="1:06.624" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.503" end="1:05.387">そうやって</span><span begin="1:05.387" end="1:05.941">自分で</span><span begin="1:05.941" end="1:06.400">全て</span><span begin="1:06.400" end="1:06.624">を</span></p><p begin="1:06.669" end="1:08.731" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.669" end="1:07.178">終わりに</span><span begin="1:07.178" end="1:08.108">してしまえば</span><span begin="1:08.166" end="1:08.731">もう</span></p><p begin="1:08.882" end="1:13.096" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.882" end="1:10.115">誰にも</span><span begin="1:10.115" end="1:11.259">会えないん</span><span begin="1:11.259" end="1:11.776">だよ</span><span begin="1:11.776" end="1:12.708">ずっ</span><span begin="1:12.708" end="1:13.096">と</span></p><p begin="1:13.106" end="1:14.587" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.106" end="1:13.847">満月の</span><span begin="1:13.847" end="1:14.587">夜に</span></p></div><div begin="1:14.469" end="1:21.225"><p begin="1:14.469" end="1:16.333" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.469" end="1:14.681">La</span><span begin="1:14.681" end="1:14.907">la-</span><span begin="1:14.995" end="1:15.155">la</span><span begin="1:15.155" end="1:15.366">la-</span><span begin="1:15.462" end="1:15.577">la</span><span begin="1:15.577" end="1:15.793">la-</span><span begin="1:15.926" end="1:16.074">la</span><span begin="1:16.074" end="1:16.333">la</span></p><p begin="1:16.942" end="1:18.806" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.942" end="1:17.154">La</span><span begin="1:17.154" end="1:17.380">la-</span><span begin="1:17.468" end="1:17.628">la</span><span begin="1:17.628" end="1:17.839">la-</span><span begin="1:17.935" end="1:18.050">la</span><span begin="1:18.050" end="1:18.266">la-</span><span begin="1:18.399" end="1:18.547">la</span><span begin="1:18.547" end="1:18.806">la</span></p><p begin="1:19.361" end="1:21.225" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.361" end="1:19.573">La</span><span begin="1:19.573" end="1:19.799">la-</span><span begin="1:19.887" end="1:20.047">la</span><span begin="1:20.047" end="1:20.258">la-</span><span begin="1:20.354" end="1:20.469">la</span><span begin="1:20.469" end="1:20.685">la-</span><span begin="1:20.818" end="1:20.966">la</span><span begin="1:20.966" end="1:21.225">la</span></p></div><div begin="1:22.438" end="1:44.672"><p begin="1:22.438" end="1:24.573" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.438" end="1:23.106">終わらせる</span><span begin="1:23.263" end="1:24.022">ことが</span><span begin="1:24.095" end="1:24.573">できず</span></p><p begin="1:24.623" end="1:27.400" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.623" end="1:24.941">地面</span><span begin="1:24.941" end="1:25.182">に</span><span begin="1:25.182" end="1:25.629">落ちた</span><span begin="1:25.629" end="1:26.094">僕に</span><span begin="1:26.259" end="1:27.400">突然</span></p><p begin="1:27.923" end="1:29.923" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.923" end="1:28.378">月が</span><span begin="1:28.499" end="1:28.997">話し</span><span begin="1:29.072" end="1:29.560">かけて</span><span begin="1:29.560" end="1:29.923">きた</span></p><p begin="1:30.030" end="1:32.702" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.030" end="1:30.446">そして</span><span begin="1:30.446" end="1:31.042">不思議な</span><span begin="1:31.042" end="1:31.502">力</span><span begin="1:31.622" end="1:31.822">を</span><span begin="1:31.888" end="1:32.221">くれ</span><span begin="1:32.221" end="1:32.702">た</span></p><p begin="1:32.712" end="1:37.630" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1: